window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Kira Logan returns from ten years in the military to her home to navigate what her life will look like back in Maine. She brings with her Winston, her loyal pup. She also brings with her PTSD, anxiety, and depression from a previous failed marriage and abuse. She is looking for herself back in her hometown when she decides to open up her heart to love again.</p> <p>Benjamin Barnett is a local builder who has issues with an ungrateful customer and is working toward his self-discovery and finding love. He never truly thought he'd want a serious relationship, never thought of having a wife... That was until he met Kira Logan again; not knowing her well in school, he got to know her very well... Beneath the Willow.</p> <p>This story contains domestic violence memories, PTSD, anxiety, explicit open-door sex scenes, and witty banter.</p>"; 
